OL,3,BFT: Stubb says Europe should talk to   
OL,4,BPutin directly                         
OL,5,GFinnish President Alexander Stubb says 
OL,6,Goutsourcing Russia-Ukraine talks to the
OL,7,GUnited States was "irresponsible."     
OL,8,K                                       
OL,9,BUnemployment in Finland to turn the    
OL,10,Bcorner by year-end, ministry says      
OL,11,GEmployment growth is expected to spread
OL,12,Gto more sectors next year as new       
OL,13,Ginvestments drive demand in            
OL,14,Gengineering, architecture and IT.      
OL,15,K                                       
OL,16,BVideo: Young people want a party of    
OL,17,Btheir own                              
OL,18,GFor some young people, Finland's       
OL,19,Gestablished political parties feel like
OL,20,Gthey belong to another generation.     
